{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3dd","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aba9-d1ff-7602-bf9f-32a3aa09bb6c"},"sequence":73,"recorded_at":1780531400000141,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"e6495f39-5100-411c-852e-b85f9d8475b0","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"e6495f39-5100-411c-852e-b85f9d8475b0","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"e6495f39-5100-411c-852e-b85f9d8475b0"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0abaa-0614-7783-ba07-7b9a38ab8d86"},"task_id":"01a0abaa-0614-7783-ba07-7b9a38ab8d86","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0abaa-0614-7783-ba07-7b9a38ab8d86","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260909-2ez769/TASK-260909-2ez769_reviewer-cr5.md`.\n1|Independently review Change Request revision 5 of TASK-260909-2ez769 (task_delta on managed checkpoint a89328ca85a613abde39660f4be749a8fcf57903, candidate tree a823eb20be497c3fa0510e7da4d3506ddb284431, published by RUN-260916-c0f186). This is the rework after the CR4 changes-requested verdict (TASK-260909-2ez769_review-verdict-rev4.md, evidence zip rev4); read that verdict, the CR4 logbook, the producer outcome TASK-260909-2ez769_results-rev5.md with TASK-260909-2ez769_producer-evidence-rev5.tar.gz and TASK-260909-2ez769_exclusion-handoff.md, the CR patch and validation log, and the exact immutable CR bytes. Superseded reviewer briefs (reviewer, reviewer-current-base, reviewer-after-rev3, reviewer-after-rev3-current) are historical; this brief governs.\n2|\n3|The producer ported the CR4 probes under new names (TestSurvivingReaderConvergesInterruptedApply, TestSurvivingReaderConvergesInterruptedRollback, TestFirstOpenPreservesHeldLock, TestConcurrentOpenAttachesToExistingLock) and claims a marker admission barrier in internal/hosttrust/joint.go and transact.go (markerPresent, convergeLocked, lockForConvergedRead), O_CREAT|O_EXCL