ing through production Open, that existing-lock contention is tested, and read the Windows initialization path for the same rule (report Windows execution honestly as unverified where no runtime ran).\n6|F3 (evidence and ownership): native Windows DACL tests must exist as real build-tagged test code driving the production custody entries for owner-only acceptance, other-principal refusal and reparse handling; without a Windows runtime, row 15 is implementation present / runtime unverified, never a pass; config-backup contents must be classified against the applicable custody contract rather than profile-ACL inheritance; row 21 must carry a precise handoff naming each downstream owning task, API and test obligation (check the notes the producer wrote on those tasks) and be counted as not consumer-driven.\n7|\n8|Retain the CR3 repairs (stale generation refusal, same/separate-Store revocation contention) and the corrected config mutation accounting; re-derive the 21-row AC table from source and named tests, counting driven/bounded/failing rows honestly; check that every claimed exit comes from a real command status and that the harmless SURVIVED control was applied through the same harness; no compile-failure, unapplied or empty-selection kills. Confirm the parked RPC artifacts and control-root backup hashes are untouched and that no candidate path overlaps the RPC manifest; confirm checkpointed SSH/peer predecessors are preserved and no RPC transport was implemented.\n9|\n10|Method: isolated immutable probes only (throwaway clone or extracted tree), never mutate the live Story worktree, index, branch or HEAD; no product edits, commits, checkpoints or integration; Curator go-testing-tools skill; all CI local. Attach TASK-260909-2ez769_review-verdict-rev5.md and TASK-260909-2ez769_review-evidence-rev5.zip, complete the live merged checklist, then accept_cr(TASK-260909-2ez769, revision=5, evidence=TASK-260909-2ez769_review-verdict-rev5.md) or hand off changes requested with P1/P2 classes and repeat-of named. Model: codex gpt-6-astra low. Canonical CLI /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board.","final_result":true}}}
