passes pass.\n13|\n14|Remove reviewer probe files from test discovery before running full package/mutation suites, because the two failing regression probes and the deliberate synchronous timeout are diagnostic additions, not candidate tests. Baseline.log was collected before adding any reviewer files.\n15|\n16|Producer battery archives are not duplicated. Retrieve TASK-260909-2ez769_producer-evidence-rev6.tar.gz from the board and extract under producer/ beside candidate/ for audit.py. Its RPC preservation checks additionally use the task's existing control-root backup paths. See verdict for exact hashes and evidence reuse bounds.","final_result":true}}}
